  "source": {
    "design": "Outage Daylight (ADR 0054): calm and light in the manner of Apple's own apps. A soft grey page (#f5f5f7) with white grouped cards, near-black ink in three steps, hairline greys, primary actions in ink, one link blue, Inter for every word. Big bold numerals answer the one question: is the power on.",
    "states": "The four power states as system-style colours: a text-safe strong colour (4.5:1 on white), a pale container, and a vivid fill for large shapes and the map. Green on, orange maybe, red out, cyan back."
